#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:2
msgid "Nutanix Prism Central"
msgstr "Nutanix Prism Central"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| offers Nutanix Prism Central Cloud integration support through "
"and official plugin. Adding the plugin to a |morpheus| appliance adds a new "
"Cloud integration type for Nutanix Prism Central. Download the plugin from "
"the |morpheus| `Plugin Exchange <https://share.morpheusdata.com/morpheus-"
"nutanix-prism/about>`_ and upload it to the appliance. Plugins are uploaded "
"at |AdmIntPlu|. See |morpheus| `plugin documentation "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/integrations/integrations.html#plugins>`_"
" for more details on adding plugins."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| offers Nutanix Prism Central Cloud integration support a través "
"de y official plugin. Adding el plugin to un |morpheus| appliance adds un "
"nuevo Cloud integration tipo para Nutanix Prism Central. Download el plugin "
"desde el |morpheus| `Plugin Exchange "
"<https://share.morpheusdata.com/morpheus-nutanix-prism/about>`_ y upload it "
"to el appliance. Plugins son uploaded at |AdmIntPlu|. See |morpheus| `plugin"
" documentation "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/integrations/integrations.html#plugins>`_"
" para más detalles on adding plugins."

