#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:21
msgid "Creating a Minimal Service Account"
msgstr "Crear Minimal Service Account"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:23
msgid ""
"Integrating Nutanix Prism Central with |morpheus| requires the use of a "
"service account which has sufficient privileges to work with all Nutanix "
"contructs that |morpheus| touches. If possible, it's recommended to use a "
"service account with full administrator rights. This is because there is "
"currently a bug on the Nutanix side that prevents limited roles from working"
" with backups and snapshots. If you choose to use the minimal role "
"permissions outlined in this section, those features will not work until the"
" bug is resolved."
msgstr ""
"Integrating Nutanix Prism Central con |morpheus| requires el use of un "
"servicio cuenta cual tiene sufficient privileges to work con todos Nutanix "
"contructs que |morpheus| touches. If possible, it's recomendado to use un "
"servicio cuenta con full administrator rights. This es porque allí es "
"actualmente un bug on el Nutanix side que prevents limited roles desde "
"working con backups y snapshots. If you choose to use el minimal role "
"permisos outlined en esta sección, esos características no work hasta el bug"
" es resolved."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:25
msgid "**Recommended Minimal Service Account**"
msgstr "**Recommended Minimal Service Account**"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:27
msgid "The user belongs to the built-in \"Prism Viewer\" role"
msgstr "El usuario belongs to el built-in \"Prism Viewer\" role"

