"Due to un actual Nutanix bug, non-administrator servicio accounts no be able"
" to utilize backup o snapshot características via |morpheus|. Users quien "
"need estos características debería integrate using un administrator servicio"
" cuenta rather than el minimal user described aquí."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:124
msgid "Adding a Nutanix Prism Central Cloud"
msgstr "Agregar Nutanix Prism Central Cloud"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:126
msgid ""
"Adding Nutanix Prism Clouds to |morpheus| requires little more than the API "
"URL and valid username and password credentials for a user with sufficient "
"access to the resources that should be utilized by |morpheus|. You'll also "
"need to ensure |morpheus| can reach the NPC appliance at its API URL."
msgstr ""
"Agregar Nutanix Prism Clouds to |morpheus| requires little more than the API"
" URL and valid username and password credentials for a user with sufficient "
"access to the resources that should be utilized by |morpheus|. You'll also "
"need to ensure |morpheus| can reach the NPC appliance at its API URL."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:128
msgid ""
"Navigate to |InfClo| and click :guilabel:`+ ADD`. As long as the Nutanix "
"Prism Central plugin has been added to the appliance and this Cloud type "
"isn't disabled in global settings (|AdmSet|), NUTANIX PRISM CENTRAL should "
"be selectable as a Cloud type to add. Select it and click :guilabel:`NEXT`."
msgstr ""
"Navegue un |InfClo| y click :guilabel:`+ AGREGAR`. As long as el Nutanix "
"Prism Central plugin tiene sido agregado to el appliance y este Cloud tipo "
"isn't deshabilitado in global configuración (|AdmSet|), NUTANIX PRISM "
"CENTRAL debería be selectable as un Cloud tipo to add. Select it y click "
":guilabel:`SIGUIENTE`."

msgid ".. image:: images/clouds/npc/pickType.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/clouds/npc/pickType.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:133
msgid ""
"At minimum, it's required to configure the following to add the new cloud:"
msgstr ""
"At mínimo, it's requerido to configure el following to add el nuevo cloud:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:135
msgid "**NAME:** A friendly name for the new NPC Cloud in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME:** A friendly nombre para el nuevo NPC Cloud in |morpheus|"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:136
msgid "**API URL:** API access URL (ex. https://xx.xx.xx.xx:9440)"
msgstr "**API URL:** API acceso URL (ex. https://xx.xx.xx.xx:9440)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:137
msgid ""
"**USERNAME:** Username for a Nutanix Prism Central service account (see the "
"previous section for recommendations on service account user role "
"configuration)"
msgstr ""
"**USERNAME:** Username para un Nutanix Prism Central servicio cuenta (see el"
" anterior sección para recommendations on servicio cuenta user role "
"configuración)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:138
msgid "**PASSWORD:** The password for the service account"
msgstr "**PASSWORD:** The contraseña para el servicio cuenta"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:139
msgid ""
"**VMM API VERSION:** Allows the user to select which VMM API versions their "
"environment will support as |morpheus| cannot auto-detect this and endpoint "
"support differs between versions"
msgstr ""
"**VMM API VERSION:** Allows el usuario to select cual VMM API versions their"
" entorno será support as |morpheus| no puede auto-detect este y endpoint "
"support differs entre versions"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:141
msgid ""
"You'll know the API URL and credentials have been entered correctly when the"
" PROJECTS dropdown becomes populated. You may choose to scope Nutanix Prism "
"Central Clouds to a specific project or scope the Cloud to all Projects. "
"Click :guilabel:`NEXT` and select a Group for the Cloud or create a new "
"Group. Click :guilabel:`NEXT` to reach the review screen and then click "
":guilabel:`COMPLETE`."
msgstr ""
"You'll know el API URL y credentials tienen sido entered correctly cuando el"
" PROJECTS desplegable becomes populated. You puede choose to scope Nutanix "
"Prism Central Clouds to un específico project o scope el Cloud to todos "
"Projects. Click :guilabel:`SIGUIENTE` y select un Group para el Cloud o "
"create un nuevo Group. Click :guilabel:`SIGUIENTE` to reach el review "
"pantalla y entonces click :guilabel:`COMPLETE`."

msgid ".. image:: images/clouds/npc/configureCloud1.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/clouds/npc/configureCloud1.png"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:146
msgid ""
"After completing the wizard, |morpheus| will immediately begin to add the "
"new Cloud and perform the first Cloud sync. Within a short time, existing "
"workloads will be discovered and onboarded into |morpheus| UI (if you've "
"chosen to discover existing workloads). The Cloud is now ready to be used as"
" a provisioning target or for day-two operations."
msgstr ""
"After completing el wizard, |morpheus| será immediately begin to add el "
"nuevo Cloud y perform el primero Cloud sync. Within un short time, existente"
" workloads será be discovered y onboarded en |morpheus| UI (if you've chosen"
" to discover existente workloads). The Cloud es ahora ready to be used as un"
" provisioning destino o para day-two operaciones."
